@startuml
title Machine Lifecycle (Linear Flow)
hide empty description

' Start
[*] --> Idle

' State 1: Idle
state "Idle (Ready)" as Idle
note right of Idle : IsBusy = false

' Transition: Command Received
Idle --> Checking : MQTT 'start' received

' State 2: Validation logic
state "Checking Prerequisites" as Checking
note right of Checking
  Binder checks DB:
  Is Printing & Cover done?
end note

' Decision Point (The If/Else)
state c1 <<choice>>
Checking --> c1

' Path A: Error / Rejection
c1 --> Idle : <b>NO</b> (Not Ready)\n<i>Log Warning</i>

' Path B: Success / Work
c1 --> Working : <b>YES</b> (Ready)

' State 3: Doing the work
state "Working (Processing)" as Working
note right of Working
  IsBusy = true
  Simulate Delay Loop
end note

' Transition: Done
Working --> Finished : Progress = 100%

' State 4: Cleanup
state "Job Finished" as Finished
note right of Finished : Publish 'done' event

' Reset
Finished --> Idle : Reset to Ready

@enduml
